{# The shell for the screens you reach without an account: signing in, signing up,
   recovering a password.

   Deliberately NOT the dashboard rail. A rail is for moving between screens, and there is
   nowhere to move: these three link to one another and to nothing else, so a sidebar there
   is a list of places you cannot go yet, taking a third of the width from the one form the
   page exists for. What replaces it is a card in the middle of the canvas. #}
<div class="yw-account-guest">
  <div class="yw-account-guest__card">
    {% block dashboard_content %}{% endblock %}
  </div>
</div>

{{ include_css('styles/dashboard.css') }}
